### List invites (Admin)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/invites
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get an Invite (Admin)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/invites/users/10/events/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Delete an Invite (Admin; returns 204 if present, 404 if missing)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/invites/users/10/events/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get Event Invites (Admin)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/invites/events/2
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get Event Invites (Manager w/o Acces)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/invites/events/2
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get Event Invites (Manager w/ Access)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/invites/events/2
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get User Invites (Admin)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/invites/users/8
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create an Invite (Admin)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/invites
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

### Put an Invite (Admin)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/invites
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "ACCEPTED",
  "userId": 6,
  "message": "Editted Msg",
  "eventId": 1
}

### Patch an Invite (Admin)

{
  "eventId": 1,
  "message": "Test Inv",
  "status": "PENDING",
  "userId": 10
}

### Again
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/invites
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "eventId": 2,
  "message": "Test Inv (Delete this)",
  "status": "PENDING",
  "userId": 10
}

### List My Invites
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/invites/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get One of My Invites
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/invites/me/2
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Respond to my invite
### This currently returns 501 until authentication is implemented.
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/invites/me/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "ACCEPTED"
}
